", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499293732_1461767708294844_4364418021628428056_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kcp2ZVBtlZ0Q7kNvwG_mT_N&_nc_oc=Adpaa4aUID5Zif8Z3ebVw1XgvRslzWEzer1vJ-jYHWg_phNCqaDWZbaevaA-Yd7jPNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87eOPxYIPVJ3NW3R-O2jpY6e4qhUx5iyq-2Zs01jKjDQ&oe=6A2AC3D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Light Runners V1", "keywords": [], "long_description": "What is Light Runners?\n\nLight Runners is a captivating VR game designed to immerse players in a tranquil yet engaging environment. Set in a serene virtual world filled with lush landscapes, calming music, and picturesque scenery, the game offers a unique experience of relaxation and creativity. The objective of Light Runners is simple yet delightful: players use virtual reality tools to create beautiful, glowing art installations throughout the game world. These installations can take the form of intricate patterns.", "short_description": "Light Runners is a captivating VR game designed to immerse players in a tranquil yet engaging environment. Set in a serene virtual world filled with lush landscapes, calming music, and picturesque scenery, the game offers a unique experience of relaxation and creativity. The objective of Light Runners is simple yet delightful: players use virtual reality tools to create beautiful, glowing art installations throughout the game world. These installations can take the form of intricate patterns."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/light-runners/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AlexVRGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/light-runners/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "